    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "IAMct",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1427,
      "name": "Implementation Notes",
      "width": 640,
      "fill": "$panel",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "stroke": "$accent2",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o0J68g",
          "name": "NotesTitle",
          "fill": "$accent2",
          "content": "Implementation Notes (read before implementation)",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "context",
          "id": "t44yg",
          "name": "1 - Sidebar",
          "width": 608,
          "height": 811,
          "content": "1 - Sidebar\nSidebar bisa di-drag untuk resize (min 200, max 320) dan collapse. Klik All expand/collapse kategori; Finished/Unfinished juga dropdown. Storage bar update live sesuai disk.\n\n2 - Table header\nSetiap kolom bisa di-resize dengan drag divider (ada min-width). Klik header untuk sort asc/desc. Header sticky saat list di-scroll (jika bagus). Kolom: Name fleksibel, lainnya fixed.\n\n3 - Table rows\nCheckbox dukung multi-select + select-all. Klik kanan membuka context menu (Resume/Pause/Delete/Buka folder). Progress, speed, dan ETA update live. Status: Finished, Downloading, Paused, Error.\n\n4 - Toolbar & search\nResume/Pause/Delete aktif hanya jika ada baris terpilih dan statusnya cocok. New Download membuka new window. Delete selalu minta konfirmasi modal dialog. Search filter live by nama file + empty state bila tidak ada hasil.\n\n5 - Dialogs\nSemua dialog modal: Esc untuk tutup, fokus terkunci di dalam. \n\n6 - New Window\nTombol Download disabled bila URL kosong/invalid. Ikon clipboard membaca URL dari clipboard. Path folder bisa browse + riwayat path.\n\n7 - Settings\nPindah tab via sidebar, tiap tab ingat posisi scroll. Toggle/dropdown langsung tersimpan (persist). Input angka di-clamp (mis. Thread 1-32, port 1-65535). Perubahan engine yang butuh restart diberi penanda.\n\n8 - Window & umum\nMin window 1100x700. Window controls (min/max/close) ikut gaya OS. Semua teks non-aksi punya tooltip bila terpotong ellipsis. Siapkan empty state, error state, dan shortcut (Ctrl+N, Delete, F5)."
        }
      ]
    }
